   2:Core/Src/device/ota_download.c ****  * @file    ota_download.c
   3:Core/Src/device/ota_download.c ****  * @brief   OneNET MQTT OTA 固件下载模块实现
   4:Core/Src/device/ota_download.c ****  *
   5:Core/Src/device/ota_download.c ****  * 流程：
   6:Core/Src/device/ota_download.c ****  *   1. 收到 $sys/.../ota/firmware/get → 提取固件信息 → 回复确认
